      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "With Udon you could just make your own UI to choose a username and then \"ban\" them. Then check for that username in OnPlayerJoined() and auto-teleport them to a bedrock triangle if they try to come back ^_^\nTechnically they would still be in the world, but they would get bored pretty quickly x3\nYou could even put some calming elevator music for them in there. And a list of the world rules for them to consider for next time :p",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
