  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-28T04:09:59.884Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A friend of mine has this furry world and we made a blacklist system for anyone who is causing trouble in the lobbies and or doing things agaisnt ToS like using Clients to clip into certain rooms that are not supposed to be accessed or telerporting. And I got the idea of just banning someone from the world in general so they cant get into an instance of the world unless its friends plus or private. It would be alot more useful for moderation of worlds.",
